    "created_at": "2016-07-19T17:13:15Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-07-19T17:13:15Z",
    "body": "If we're using incumbent for source we might as well use it for everything else here, so that the implementation can just get one thing and pass it around, which reduces the chances of bugs.\n\nWe should definitely write WPT tests for this stuff to preserve the blackbox testing work that's happening. :-)\n",
